# Author: Tigany Zarrouk (tiganyzarrouk@gmail.com)
#
# No convention stated. A shielding broadened against a shift target is the
# mirror image of the right answer, and the scale fit would hide it, so this
# must stop rather than run.
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
read_data       data/succinic.data
pair_style      zero 3.0
pair_coeff      * *
group           gH type 1
compute         cs all mad/property/python mad_shiftml ncomp 1 pbc yes
fix             mad gH mad/nmr c_cs target nmr_H.dat range 5.0 40.0 141 sigma 1.5 gamma 1.0
run 0
